One extra thought. <br><br>Frequency calibration of the MD9600 is actually done using the two pots at the front of the main board. One for UHF and one for VHF. There is also a software frequency adjustment but it appears that TYT always set this to the same value and the factory calibration is done using the pots. <br><br>Colin G4EML.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=87">G4EML</a> — Mon Mar 28, 2022 6:48 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
